OL,3,GNEWSARailway crimes cost North West
OL,4,A#7.8m last year
OL,5,
OL,6,FRailway crimes in the North West cost
OL,7,Ftaxpayers #7.8m last year, with
OL,8,Ftrespassing accounting for nearly #6m
OL,9,Fof that total, Network Rail said.
OL,11,FIt said trespassing was not only
OL,12,F"extremely dangerous" but also one of
OL,13,Fthe biggest contributors to delays for
OL,14,Fpassenger and freight services.
OL,16,FLast year, trespass incidents across
OL,17,Fthe region caused 141,000 minutes of
OL,18,Fdelays to individual train services,
OL,19,Fthe equivalent of more than three
OL,20,Fmonths of delayed trains, the operator
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
